  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="30a540a3-faaa-5a2e-8c8d-86088774d3bf" activityNameId="e132b127-e437-57f4-a388-39aa43c3ccf5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste paper, sorted, for further treatment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste paper, sorted, for further treatment
Personal communication with the European Paper &amp; Pulp Industry, together with information from literature, is used in order to establish the dataset.  All waste is assumed to be incinerated. The dataset represents the input material for DIP process, as delivered to the factory gate.;
UUID: f14e2b43-687c-3d4d-9f3d-8ec12f3ffb2a
This module includes the efforts for sorting collected paper (energy, materials), the treatment of the waste fractions extracted plus the subsequent transport to a paper production site.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: typical technology used in Europe arround 2005
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f14e2b43-687c-3d4d-9f3d-8ec12f3ffb2a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
